This directory vendors the built output of `@deepseek-ai/dsh-storage-sqlite`
version `0.1.0-rc.6`, published from the upstream DeepSeek Harness monorepo
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, directory
`packages/storage/storage-sqlite`).

It is vendored rather than declared as an npm dependency because this bundle
must install from a single self-contained tarball (see CLAUDE.md §3/ADR-01);
the upstream package is not otherwise reachable at bundle-install time.

The vendored `lib/index.js` and `lib/invariant.js` are the unmodified build
output published at `0.1.0-rc.6`; `LICENSE` in this directory is copied
verbatim from that release.

